ration shell with Policy and Claims remotes\n\n- Shell host with login, layout, routing and per-remote Error Boundary/Suspense\n- Policy remote: server-paginated list, filters, optimistic auto-renew toggle\n- Claims remote: live status updates over a socket, useDeferredValue filtering, new-claim form\n- Shared singleton package: Zustand auth store, Axios client with single-flight\n  token refresh, typed event bus, design tokens for Ant Design and Tailwind\n- Mock REST backend (Axios adapter) and mock WebSocket\n- Vitest tests, GitHub Actions and Jenkinsfile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DHfMFdajHbZaSSv6DXe4Nw","tree":{"sha":"586f7eb1e5aee3211f4ac1d12ea27f0e8e9dde27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamzerol/insurance-microfrontends/git/trees/586f7eb1e5aee3211f4ac1d12ea27f0e8e9dde27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gamzerol/insurance-microfrontends/git/commits/d9b1cf2a11bea4efd062307827ccd3926f29cea5","verification":{"payload":"tree 586f7eb1e5aee3211f4ac1d12ea27f0e8e9dde27\nauthor gamzerol <erol.gmze@gmail.com> 1790863171 +0300\ncommitter gamzerol <erol.gmze@gmail.com> 1790863171 +0300\n\nMicro frontend demo: Module Federation shell with Policy and Claims remotes\n\n- Shell host with login, layout, routing and per-remote Error Boundary/Suspense\n- Policy remote: server-paginated list, filters, optimistic auto-renew toggle\n- Claims remote: live status updates over a socket, useDeferredValue filtering, new-claim form\n- Shared singleton package: Zustand auth store, Axios client with single-flight\n  token refresh, typed event bus, design tokens for Ant Design and Tailwind\n- Mock REST backend (Axios adapter) and mock WebSocket\n- Vitest tests, GitHub Actions and Jenkinsfile\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DHfMFdajHbZaSSv6DXe4Nw\n","reason":"unknown_key","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAA