026-10-04T21:17:25Z","email":"diyavirmani41@gmail.com","name":"Diya virmani"},"message":"test: add a bounded live organizer journey and record final verification\n\nAn opt-in Playwright journey covers audience and attendee entry,\nrequirements, review, discovery, the suggested setup, an original source,\na public contact route, a gallery, and saving and restoring a private\nresearch draft. It also checks locality refinement and that students are\nnot treated as founders. It refuses a fourth discovery call, and a dry\nmode rehearses the same steps with a discovery fixture.\n\nThe one live run (three sequential calls, isolated SQLite) passed. The\nbuild log records its results, CI runs and remaining limitations.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"525986a3cbf154cde4f1c6d578fb718f999bfefb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diyaavirmani/backstage/git/trees/525986a3cbf154cde4f1c6d578fb718f999bfefb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diyaavirmani/backstage/git/commits/19aa7dcb372043cfb2304f94617b4d9b0d43231b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203604786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/diyaavirmani","id":203604786,"login":"diyaavirmani","node_id":"U_kgDODCLDMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/diyaavirmani/backstage/commit/19aa7dcb372043cfb2304f94617b4d9b0d43231b","node_id":"C_kwDOU31JKdoAKDE5YWE3ZGNiMzcyMDQzY2ZiMjMwNGY5NDYxN2I0ZDliMGQ0MzIzMWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/diyaavirmani/backstage/commit/b76cc4dd1a076b2869e7a7aa76b5033400b170a0","sha":"b76cc4dd1a076b2869e7a7aa76b5033400b170a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diyaavirmani/backstage/commits/b76cc4dd1a076b2869e7a7aa76b5033400b170a0"}],"sha":"19aa7dcb372043cfb2304f94617b4d9b0d43231b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diyaavirmani/backstage/commits/19aa7dcb372043cfb2304f94617b4d9b0d43231b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203604786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/diyaavirmani","id":203604786,"login":"diyaavirmani","node_id":"U_kgDODCLDMg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diyaavirmani/backstage/commits/b76cc4dd1a076b2869e7a7aa76b5033400b170a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:10:58Z","email":"diyavirmani41@gmail.com","name":"Diya virmani"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T21:10:58Z","email":"diyavirmani41@gmail.com","name":"Diya virmani"},"message":"feat: add compact official venue photos and accessible galleries\n\nCards gain one fixed-size thumbnail labelled \"View photos (n)\". Mouse\nhover or keyboard focus previews three more thumbnails, fetched only\nthen; click or tap opens the shared accessible dialog with arrow, button\nand swipe navigation, captions, branch location evidence, credits,\nsources and load-failure fallbacks.\n\n19 photos were verified by viewing them and attributed only with branch\nevidence: Ofis Sohna Road (4), Ofis Sector 62 (6), SAIACS (5, one\nlabelled accommodation) and Shifu Den (4). Masters'' Union terms forbid\nrepublishing, so it links to the official photo page instead. Paytm has\nnone. Photos are separate venueGallery documents, normalized\nserver-side against an allowlist of official image hosts and loaded\ndirectly from them with no Backstage proxy. They never reach the model,\nrequirement classification or private drafts.\n\nModal detail dialogs are centered again (Tailwind preflight had zeroed\ntheir margins) and long titles no longer squeeze the Close button.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0cb08211acd0e676e31847625efb387f90731931","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diyaavirmani/backstage/git/trees/0cb08211acd0e676e31847625efb387f90731931"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diyaavirmani/backstage/git/commits/b76cc4dd1a076b2869e7a7aa76b5033400b170a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/203604786?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavirmani/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diyaavi