t-in; use Vercel production URL as canonical fallback\n\n- robots.txt disallows everything and every response carries\n  X-Robots-Tag: noindex until SITE_INDEXABLE=true is set at launch,\n  so unapproved working copy on *.vercel.app stays out of search\n- siteUrl() falls back to VERCEL_PROJECT_PRODUCTION_URL when\n  NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL is not set\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ac9d349e8c4c40e499509148b3f26150588f09f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/git/trees/1ac9d349e8c4c40e499509148b3f26150588f09f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/git/commits/0bd3ef23f977d424403fe9f29776f1978adfcae1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97200044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Earthiscool","id":97200044,"login":"Earthiscool","node_id":"U_kgDOBcsnrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/commit/0bd3ef23f977d424403fe9f29776f1978adfcae1","node_id":"C_kwDOU32I3toAKDBiZDNlZjIzZjk3N2Q0MjQ0MDNmZTlmMjk3NzZmMTk3OGFkZmNhZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/commit/e03522b77797351c60f8fe22bc2d5aade949ba47","sha":"e03522b77797351c60f8fe22bc2d5aade949ba47","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/commits/e03522b77797351c60f8fe22bc2d5aade949ba47"}],"sha":"0bd3ef23f977d424403fe9f29776f1978adfcae1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/commits/0bd3ef23f977d424403fe9f29776f1978adfcae1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97200044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Earthiscool","id":97200044,"login":"Earthiscool","node_id":"U_kgDOBcsnrA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/commits/e03522b77797351c60f8fe22bc2d5aade949ba47/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:27:16Z","email":"mailtoagastyab@gmail.com","name":"AgastyaB"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T00:27:16Z","email":"mailtoagastyab@gmail.com","name":"AgastyaB"},"message":"Build IWC website: Next.js 16 + Sanity CMS + OpenAI assistant\n\nComplete Phase 1 site for Integrative Wellbeing & Chiropractic, built from\nthe Brand Strategy Brief and Rebuild Blueprint (incl. handwritten edits).\n\n- Homepage in the blueprint''s 12-section order with the \"whole picture\"\n  signature graphic; Start Here guided selector; 4 pathways; 6 service and\n  program pages; About/Dr. Jenn; team; resources + 3 articles; For Providers;\n  Book a Visit; FAQ; legal pages\n- Sanity Studio at /studio: editor-friendly structure, singletons, required\n  alt text, permission-gated testimonials, Presentation preview, draft mode,\n  signed publish webhook revalidation, non-destructive content seeder\n- Website assistant: server-side OpenAI Responses streaming grounded in\n  published CMS content (BM25 retrieval), emergency short-circuit, identifier\n  redaction, store:false, rate limiting, honest unavailable state\n- Forms via Server Actions + Resend with honeypot, signed time token,\n  optional Turnstile, rate limiting; no clinical intake\n- SEO: metadata, canonicals, sitemap, robots, JSON-LD, 301 map from Wix URLs\n- Privacy-safe GA4 events; WCAG 2.2 AA (axe) checks; security headers\n- 83 Playwright tests, CMS workflow (39/39) and assistant-knowledge checks\n- Docs: README, editor guide, deployment runbook, implementation status,\n  client approval checklist\n\nBrand colors, logo, fonts, prices, credentials and legal copy are\nprovisional pending client approval (docs/CLIENT_APPROVAL_CHECKLIST.md).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a6a012bdfbe94158b0cc95416daaf75a27bf03cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/git/trees/a6a012bdfbe94158b0cc95416daaf75a27bf03cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Earthiscool/Chirpocator-Webiste/git/commits/e03522b77797351c60f8fe22bc2d5aade949ba47","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/97200044?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Earthiscool/followers","f