data display.\n- Added Tabs component with list, trigger, and content for tabbed navigation.\n\nfeat: implement event handling with React Query and WebSocket\n\n- Introduced useEvents and useAnalytics hooks for fetching events and analytics data using React Query.\n- Added useCreateEvent hook for creating events and invalidating related queries on success.\n- Implemented useWebSocket hook for real-time event handling via WebSocket.\n\nfeat: establish API for event management\n\n- Created API functions for fetching events, analytics, and creating events with error handling.\n- Defined TypeScript types for events and analytics responses.\n\nfeat: enhance server with WebSocket support\n\n- Integrated WebSocket server for real-time event broadcasting.\n- Added event emitter for handling event creation and broadcasting to connected clients.\n- Updated server initialization to include WebSocket server setup.\n\nstyle: update CSS variables for theming\n\n- Refactored CSS variables for improved theming consistency across the application.\n- Adjusted dark mode styles for better contrast and readability.\n\nfix: update TypeScript configuration and dependencies\n\n- Removed baseUrl from tsconfig.app.json for cleaner configuration.\n- Updated package dependencies for server and client to include WebSocket support.","tree":{"sha":"caf479583b91846a08f2e873569a17aa4a2d9000","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajan-marasini/nepa_tasks/git/trees/caf479583b91846a08f2e873569a17aa4a2d9000"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rajan-marasini/nepa_tasks/git/commits/057eb0ac5d73b2403904d63301e8b2222a7651e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/122443030?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajan-marasini/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajan-marasini/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rajan