tter":{"date":"2026-10-02T12:02:01Z","email":"deepuanirudh@gmail.com","name":"deepakbeatz"},"message":"Set up new machines from a committed test.env\n\ndev-setup.sh now creates .env by copying test.env, the team''s development\nsettings, instead of .env.example. While copying it swaps the LAN address\ntest.env was made on for this machine''s own in every setting that uses one\n(today S3_ENDPOINT and MOBILE_API_BASE_URL), so product images and the\nmobile apps work on any machine. IP=… overrides detection; localhost is the\nfallback. test.env is only ever read, and an existing .env is left alone.\n\ntest.env carries no secrets: mail goes to MailHog, the Razorpay keys are\nplaceholders and the webhook secret is the local default. Real keys belong\nin each developer''s own, gitignored .env.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf8fb90b04681129910d08ffcaa94aaa889f1df3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vayalavan/vayalavan/git/trees/cf8fb90b04681129910d08ffcaa94aaa889f1df3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vayalavan/vayalavan/git/commits/8f9ec151c8bf1a33c87f25eb70e3903ae037afd4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32365694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deepakrajaps","id":32365694,"login":"deepakrajaps","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzY1Njk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Vayalavan/vayalavan/commit/8f9ec151c8bf1a33c87f25eb70e3903ae037afd4","node_id":"C_kwDOU4opvNoAKDhmOWVjMTUxYzhiZjFhMzNjODdmMjVlYjcwZTM5MDNhZTAzN2FmZDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Vayalavan/vayalavan/commit/e63896fb13cae25919181e02054a447da8caebc5","sha":"e63896fb13cae25919181e02054a447da8caebc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vayalavan/vayalavan/commits/e63896fb13cae25919181e02054a447da8caebc5"}],"sha":"8f9ec151c8bf1a33c87f25eb70e3903ae037afd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vayalavan/vayalavan/commits/8f9ec151c8bf1a33c87f25eb70e3903ae037afd4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32365694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deepakrajaps","id":32365694,"login":"deepakrajaps","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzY1Njk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vayalavan/vayalavan/commits/e63896fb13cae25919181e02054a447da8caebc5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:26:19Z","email":"deepuanirudh@gmail.com","name":"deepakbeatz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T11:26:19Z","email":"deepuanirudh@gmail.com","name":"deepakbeatz"},"message":"Initial commit: Vayalavan platform\n\nCustomer, admin and supplier web UIs, the two Expo apps, the gateway, the\nprofile/catalog/orders Go services, and the analytics pipeline:\ntransactional outbox + Postgres logical replication into an analytics\nschema (vm-events-consumer-api), read by vm-analytics-api, shown in the\nadmin console''s Analytics tab and to the analyst role.\n\n./dev-setup.sh sets up a new machine; ./start.sh runs everything.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ca51b2f190f7157bc0e88b189fe4a5cf4ad6225d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vayalavan/vayalavan/git/trees/ca51b2f190f7157bc0e88b189fe4a5cf4ad6225d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Vayalavan/vayalavan/git/commits/e63896fb13cae25919181e02054a447da8caebc5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32365694?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/deepakrajaps","id":32365694,"login":"deepakrajaps","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyMzY1Njk0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/deepakrajaps/subscriptions","type":"User","url