url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanbr/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanbr/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanbr/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanbr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanbr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ryanbr","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryanbr/gtm-rr/commits/5503e5102c0ce2b2ecc7293bf87286f414c06ae8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:27:57Z","email":"mp3geek@gmail.com","name":"Fanboynz"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T23:27:57Z","email":"mp3geek@gmail.com","name":"Fanboynz"},"message":"README: the install block was three lines that cannot work\n\nA hidden setting is a name and the rest of that one line, and a later line\nreplaces an earlier one. So three bare URL lines left userResourcesLocation\nunset, and repeating the name on three lines kept only the last URL - with\nthe resources that did not load saying nothing at all. Field-reported: with\nthe three lines, only gtm-tag.js was live.","tree":{"sha":"8aa1c1048c0eb7534d5cac9e17fa921895fa375b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryanbr/gtm-rr/git/trees/8aa1c1048c0eb7534d5cac9e17fa921895fa375b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ryanbr/gtm-rr/git/commits/5503e5102c0ce2b2ecc7293bf87286f414c06ae8","verification":{"payload":"tree 8aa1c1048c0eb7534d5cac9e17fa921895fa375b\nparent ffb6b9b0b1fefa07cc4c0f0b4684ba05e5ee26de\nauthor Fanboynz <mp3geek@gmail.com> 1790983677 +1300\ncommitter Fanboynz <mp3geek@gmail.com> 1790983677 +1300\n\nREADME: the install block was three lines that cannot work\n\nA hidden setting is a name and the rest of that one line, and a later line\nreplaces an earlier one. So three bare URL lines left userResourcesLocation\nunset, and repeating the name on three lines kept only the last URL - with\nthe resources that did not load 