ithub.com/users/dhia10/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhia10/EstateMind/commits/1c7a90c7679f4b7796c1f239541b919278463d87/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:43:10Z","email":"dhia.romd1@gmail.com","name":"dhia10"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:43:10Z","email":"dhia.romd1@gmail.com","name":"dhia10"},"message":"fix: villa3d CORS — async stub + nginx routing\n\nvilla3d-stub/main.py:\n- Rewrite with httpx + asyncio.sleep (was time.sleep which blocked the\n  event loop, preventing CORS preflight OPTIONS from being served)\n- Proper async: _tripo_post, _tripo_get, _upload_image, _poll_task,\n  _finish_glb all use httpx.AsyncClient and await asyncio.sleep(4)\n\nvilla3d-stub/Dockerfile:\n- Add httpx to pip install\n\nnginx.azure.conf:\n- Add /villa3d/ location block proxying to immo-villa3d:8056\n- Frontend now calls http://IP/villa3d/* (same origin) — zero CORS\n\ndocker-compose.azure.yml:\n- NEXT_PUBLIC_VILLA3D_API_URL now uses http://${SERVER_HOST}/villa3d\n  (routes through nginx port 80, not port 8056 directly)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cf014732d4ec6cf9c1d79187c6c4da2d610ec6a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhia10/EstateMind/git/trees/cf014732d4ec6cf9c1d79187c6c4da2d610ec6a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhia10/EstateMind/git/commits/1c7a90c7679f4b7796c1f239541b919278463d87","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20670848?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"