:"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhia10/EstateMind/commits/75a45a7b8da7ac26b52fd315b0044d6fc3171f9c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:24:16Z","email":"dhia.romd1@gmail.com","name":"dhia10"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-05T20:24:16Z","email":"dhia.romd1@gmail.com","name":"dhia10"},"message":"fix: devis ChromaDB HNSW crash + villa3d full Tripo endpoints\n\ndevis agent:\n- Switch PersistentClient → EphemeralClient in vector_store.py\n  ChromaDB 1.5.9 Rust HNSW backend fails on persistent storage.\n  Dataset is 59 rows, re-indexes in <5s on startup. No data loss.\n\nvilla3d-stub:\n- Add /generate3d-text (JSON body → Tripo text_to_model, polls + GLB)\n- Add /convert3d-direct (upload → Tripo image_to_model)\n- Add /convert3d-multiview (upload → Tripo with multiview_consistency)\n- Add /download/{filename} to serve cached GLB files\n- /health now returns sd_status:error so frontend stops polling SD\n- All endpoints poll Tripo until done and return {url, filename, size_kb}\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4baeb4955d91a88f310df8694af5ddecd138cb36","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhia10/EstateMind/git/trees/4baeb4955d91a88f310df8694af5ddecd138cb36"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhia10/EstateMind/git/commits/75a45a7b8da7ac26b52fd315b0044d6fc3171f9c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20670848?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dhia10/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://g