a@gmail.com","name":"Diego Garcia"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:49:09Z","email":"diegohernangarcia@gmail.com","name":"Diego Garcia"},"message":"feat: implementar Módulo #10 Consolidador de Archivos Excel y actualizar catálogo a 10 Desarrolladas\n\n- Módulo #10 (excel-consolidator): Motor multi-buffer SheetJS, fusión de esquemas (Outer/Inner/Template), trazabilidad con columna de origen y omisión de cabeceras.\n- Interfaz en 3 pasos con presets de prueba, reordenamiento interactivo de archivos y vista previa individual.\n- Centro de ayuda interactivo con 6 pestañas y soporte responsive.\n- Actualización de estado en apps-data.js y main.js a ''desarrollada'' con tilde verde.\n- Actualización de KPI en index.html a 10 Desarrolladas / 100% Operativas.\n- Documentación técnica completa en docs/10-excel-consolidator.md y actualización de README.md.","tree":{"sha":"6fe3a296d6cdec625fdb813a9e752df89dd72cd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegohernangarcia/SimpleApp/git/trees/6fe3a296d6cdec625fdb813a9e752df89dd72cd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diegohernangarcia/SimpleApp/git/commits/e1963861e412f820e95648330014d3cc6a35b1e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2248417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegohernangarcia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegohernangarcia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegohernangarcia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegohernangarcia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/diegohernangarcia","id":2248417,"login":"diegohernangarcia","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyNDg0MTc=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegohernangarcia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/diegohernangarcia/received_events","repos_url":"https:/