s://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy","id":251733208,"login":"Shanwazmojaloy","node_id":"U_kgDODwEk2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commits/ee28f2f7fc3b8b2f562b2d60c699105f651e8108/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:47:10Z","email":"251733208+Shanwazmojaloy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shanwazmojaloy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:47:10Z","email":"251733208+Shanwazmojaloy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shanwazmojaloy"},"message":"Move the runtime pin from Node 22.x to Node 24.x\n\nThe Vercel project is set to Node.js 24.x, so every build printed the\n\"Due to \\\"engines\\\": { \\\"node\\\": \\\"22.x\\\" } ... Node.js Version \\\"22.x\\\" will be\nused instead\" warning and ignored the dashboard setting. Pin the repo to\nthe runtime the dashboard already uses instead of forcing 22.x.\n\n- package.json: engines.node 22.x -> 24.x\n- .nvmrc: 22 -> 24 (CI resolves its version from this file)\n- package.json: @types/node ^22.20.5 -> ^24.19.1, lockfile refreshed\n  (@types/node 24.19.1, undici-types 7.24.6)\n- README: 24.x in the local-run, Vercel checklist, CI, and stack sections;\n  the checklist now also spells out this specific warning so a future\n  drift between the dashboard and engines.node is self-diagnosing\n- tests/deploy-config.test.ts: expect .nvmrc \"24\"; drop the hardcoded\n  major from the CI comment so it cannot go stale\n\nVerified on Node 24.21.0 with a clean `npm ci --include=dev`: lint,\ntypecheck, 59/59 Vitest tests, and the Next.js production build all pass,\nwith no EBADENGINE warnings.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a5fd9ba6729bae7697e76b6cdb006360fcce28e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/git/trees/a5fd9ba6729bae7697e76b6cdb006360fcce28e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/git/commits/ee28f2f7fc3b8b2f562b2d60c699105f651e8108","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251733208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy","id":251733208,"login":"Shanwazmojaloy","node_id":"U_kgDODwEk2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/ee28f2f7fc3b8b2f562b2d60c699105f651e8108","node_id":"C_kwDOU5dezNoAKGVlMjhmMmY3ZmMzYjhiMmY1NjJiMmQ2MGM2OTkxMDVmNjUxZTgxMDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/b8c08560b2803f51e96dc8ca6c7705