,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commits/7fef1f680506da304c497b94278a7f60b92525c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:32:21Z","email":"251733208+Shanwazmojaloy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shanwazmojaloy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T01:32:21Z","email":"251733208+Shanwazmojaloy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shanwazmojaloy"},"message":"test(deploy): close paste-drift gaps in the Vercel deploy guard\n\nAdds five assertions to tests/deploy-config.test.ts that a malformed or\nhalf-applied vercel.json would otherwise survive:\n\n- vercel.json carries exactly the five intended top-level keys. The\n  published schema sets additionalProperties:false, so a stray key from a\n  truncated paste is rejected at deploy time with an opaque\n  \"invalid vercel.json\"; this names the offending key in CI instead.\n- next.config.ts still wraps the config in withMicrofrontends, without\n  which microfrontends.json never reaches the build output and the\n  blocking mfe-config-present check fails on production deploys.\n- microfrontends.json $schema stays a plain URL, the same markdown-link\n  paste hazard already guarded for vercel.json.\n- CI resolves its Node.js version from .nvmrc rather than a hardcoded\n  major that silently drifts from engines.node.\n- The README''s Production Deployment section documents the same build\n  command, install command, and output directory vercel.json pins.\n  Scoped to that section because the same strings also appear under\n  Checks & Verification, where a whole-file match would pass anyway.\n\nEach assertion was verified by mutating the target file and confirming\nthe suite goes red. Suite: 54 -> 59 tests.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"4dfca7bc54a0af13c2b9b03efd7bd3ccb5188a1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/git/trees/4dfca7bc54a0af13c2b9b03efd7bd3ccb5188a1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/git/commits/7fef1f680506da304c497b94278a7f60b92525c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251733208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy","id":251733208,"login":"Shanwazmojaloy","node_id":"U_kgDODwEk2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/7fef1f680506da304c497b94278a7f60b92525c4","node_id":"C_kwDOU5dezNoAKDdmZWYxZjY4MDUwNmRhMzA0YzQ5N2I5NDI3OGE3ZjYwYjkyNTI1YzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/f72a65b4edb47cdf5a105d3228c0cc6367a78144","sha":"f72a65b4edb47cdf5a10