,"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/b40752dd0cb5cab5d057d795ecf08b97c9b7d79a","node_id":"C_kwDOU5dezNoAKGI0MDc1MmRkMGNiNWNhYjVkMDU3ZDc5NWVjZjA4Yjk3YzliN2Q3OWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/6b234e16e3f12881e6e09399e1de57f6bcfd875b","sha":"6b234e16e3f12881e6e09399e1de57f6bcfd875b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commits/6b234e16e3f12881e6e09399e1de57f6bcfd875b"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/731d2f1f7fb30134e8df3745a6bd1e449f02affa","sha":"731d2f1f7fb30134e8df3745a6bd1e449f02affa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commits/731d2f1f7fb30134e8df3745a6bd1e449f02affa"}],"sha":"b40752dd0cb5cab5d057d795ecf08b97c9b7d79a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commits/b40752dd0cb5cab5d057d795ecf08b97c9b7d79a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251733208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy","id":251733208,"login":"Shanwazmojaloy","node_id":"U_kgDODwEk2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commits/731d2f1f7fb30134e8df3745a6bd1e449f02affa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:50:20Z","email":"251733208+Shanwazmojaloy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shanwazmojaloy"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T00:50:20Z","email":"251733208+Shanwazmojaloy@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Shanwazmojaloy"},"message":"docs(deploy): document deployment-check gating and commit-attribution blockers\n\nBoth blockers are evidenced by the Vercel commit statuses on main:\n\n- ''Checks for Deployment have failed'' (0a5e313f, 6b234e16): Vercel holds\n  production deployments until all required Deployment Checks pass, so a\n  green build that is never released is a check failure, not a build\n  failure. Document how to inspect and rescope the native checks, and the\n  Microfrontends Config Present (mfe-config-present) check: it is blocking\n  by default only for the default app of a Microfrontends group and applies\n  to production deployments only, so it is a no-op for this single-app repo\n  unless the project was enrolled in a group by mistake. Includes the\n  removal path (Settings > Microfrontends, or vercel microfrontends\n  inspect-group / delete-group).\n- ''GitHub couldn''t verify an account for the commit'' (9b9cc41c, authored and\n  committed by agent@arena.ai): on a private repo without Pro, every commit\n  covered by a deployment must be authored with an email linked to the\n  GitHub account that owns the project. Records the correct repository-local\n  identity and the account-reconnect fix for a stale mapping.\n\nAlso clarifies that the mfe-config-present line is an applicability note,\nnot the build error the failed-deployment flow is looking for.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9b007d5fb40e9741c8b14d13eb3630ada7bfe414","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/git/trees/9b007d5fb40e9741c8b14d13eb3630ada7bfe414"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/git/commits/731d2f1f7fb30134e8df3745a6bd1e449f02affa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/251733208?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy","id":251733208,"login":"Shanwazmojaloy","node_id":"U_kgDODwEk2A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Shanwazmojaloy","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/731d2f1f7fb30134e8df3745a6bd1e449f02affa","node_id":"C_kwDOU5dezNoAKDczMWQyZjFmN2ZiMzAxMzRlOGRmMzc0NWE2YmQxZTQ0OWYwMmFmZmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commit/6b234e16e3f12881e6e09399e1de57f6bcfd875b","sha":"6b234e16e3f12881e6e09399e1de57f6bcfd875b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commits/6b234e16e3f12881e6e09399e1de57f6bcfd875b"}],"sha":"731d2f1f7fb30134e8df3745a6bd1e449f02affa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Shanwazmojaloy/hotel-growthos/commits/731d2f1f7fb30134e8df3745a6bd1e449f02affa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubu