t-agnostic), fix NULL tenant_id scan in GetUserByEmail\n- gateway: /v1/platform/ route, suspension exempts tenant lifecycle +\n  platform paths, configurable TENANT_CACHE_TTL\n- web: /signup (create market → auto-login → own admin), /platform\n  panel (markets table with suspend/activate/create, platform users\n  with invite/disable), role-guarded routes + nav links\n- smoke: platform role gating, suspend→reactivate, invite/disable\n- README/AGENTS: platform admin docs and known public-signup gap","tree":{"sha":"73e44c35612ddc85ffc406eb2a826fc4b8cfc07f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mathif92/market-master/git/trees/73e44c35612ddc85ffc406eb2a826fc4b8cfc07f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mathif92/market-master/git/commits/18417df7ec6873d0709ea499b993d31483a3e58d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8659872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mathif92","id":8659872,"login":"mathif92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTk4NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mathif92/market-master/commit/18417df7ec6873d0709ea499b993d31483a3e58d","node_id":"C_kwDOU5rGEtoAKDE4NDE3ZGY3ZWM2ODczZDA3MDllYTQ5OWI5O