n  bearer auth with transparent token refresh, Idempotency-Key generation,\n  typed ApiError mapping\n- Shop: catalog + filters, product page, localStorage cart, checkout\n  (order + simulated PSP card), live order tracking, my orders\n- Admin (/admin, staff-gated): dashboard, catalog CRUD, orders +\n  detail (cancel/deliver), shipments, shipping methods, users\n- Deploy: deploy/web.Dockerfile (node build → nginx, /v1 → gateway),\n  compose web service on :8089; make web-dev/web/web-build/web-lint\n- Docs: README web section, AGENTS.md commands/layout/testing","tree":{"sha":"fe038711005c59d2d99fd05c9dd76ef7d86c87dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mathif92/market-master/git/trees/fe038711005c59d2d99fd05c9dd76ef7d86c87dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mathif92/market-master/git/commits/e6cc23e7f0bbd78ae8db364673e6c630a053ed01","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8659872?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mathif92","id":8659872,"login":"mathif92","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NTk4NzI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mathif92","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/mathif92/market-master/commit/e6cc23e7f0bbd78ae8db364673e6c630a053ed01