ays of the calls; saved searches (SDK 0.6.0)\n\nThe search page takes the facts of a call from the address (campaign, agent, disposition, from,\nto) with the values and counts from likho-api, and keeps a search for later under a name,\nshared by the workspace. The e2e proves \"every sale call of one agent last week with a word\nis one search\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b88a791233736c5918317cedc21ff08cc8c5afa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/trees/b88a791233736c5918317cedc21ff08cc8c5afa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/commits/df06cfb574bb8d434f67bd37309f73cd2fd1154e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/df06cfb574bb8d434f67bd37309f73cd2fd1154e","node_id":"C_kwDOU52059oAKGRmMDZjZmI1NzRiYjhkNDM0ZjY3YmQzNzMwOWY3M2NkMmZkMTE1NGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/38c6fb91a71da946aafb773324136273fee84c8c","sha":"38c6fb91a71da946aafb773324136273fee84c8c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/38c6fb91a71da946aafb773324136273fee84c8c"}],"sha":"df06cfb574bb8d434f67bd37309f73cd2fd1154e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/df06cfb574bb8d434f67bd37309f73cd2fd1154e"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/38c6fb91a71da946aafb773324136273fee84c8c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:50:51Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T09:50:51Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"message":"e2e: a name added to the vocabulary is heard in the next transcription, and its count rises\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db94227322