7cf7295e73c7767172608002031116","node_id":"C_kwDOU52059oAKDNhNGRkZTRiNmI3Y2Y3Mjk1ZTczYzc3NjcxNzI2MDgwMDIwMzExMTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/50bd632641794e192db5a6252008dda756154e03","sha":"50bd632641794e192db5a6252008dda756154e03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/50bd632641794e192db5a6252008dda756154e03"}],"sha":"3a4dde4b6b7cf7295e73c7767172608002031116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/3a4dde4b6b7cf7295e73c7767172608002031116"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/50bd632641794e192db5a6252008dda756154e03/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:58:44Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:58:44Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"message":"People: the admin app at /admin, invitation and reset pages, roles in the bar\n\nSDK 0.4. Routes: /admin loads likho-mfe-admin (admins see the link);\n/invite/:token shows whom the link is for and takes a name and a\npassword; \"Forgotten your password?\" on sign-in leads to /forgot, which\nmails a link to /reset/:token. The settings page is now personal\n(appearance, own password); the workspace''s settings and API keys moved\nto the admin app. A viewer gets no upload button and no Admin section.\n\nThe browser test invites a viewer who joins through the link, sees no\nupload, is made a member and then disabled (signed out at once), and\nthe audit log has every step.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f217d066d8bafdffee9183499bcadb8267eb65fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/trees/f217d066d8bafdffee9183499bcadb8267eb65fd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/commits/50bd632641794e192db5a6252008dda756154e03","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/50bd632641794e192db5a6252008dda756154e03","node_id":"C_kwDOU52059oAKDUwYmQ2MzI2NDE3OTRlMTkyZGI1YTYyNTIwMDhkZGE3NTYxNTRlMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/252ee87aa3bd98bc7260152ab30ee70ab29c4479","sha":"252ee87aa3bd98bc7260152ab30ee70ab29c4479","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/252ee87aa3bd98bc7260152ab30ee70ab29c4479"}],"sha":"50bd632641794e192db5a6252008dda756154e03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/50bd632641794e192db5a6252008dda756154e03"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/252ee87aa3bd98bc7260152ab30ee70ab29c4479/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:14:33Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T05:14:33Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"message":"Search: a hit opens the exact moment; the same words again ask again\n\nA hit links to the line''s exact start (a line may begin at 0.4 s, and a\nmoment of 0 would mark nothing). Submitting the same words again refetches,\nsince a line corrected a moment ago may have reached the index since. The\nbrowser test corrects a line, finds the corrected word, opens it at its\nmoment, and checks the deleted recording by its id.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f7cda94bbab72366757ec84f7561f3ff1e7cdc26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/trees/f7cda94bbab72366757ec84f7561f3ff1e7cdc26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/commits/252ee87aa3bd98bc7260152ab30ee70ab29c4479","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://git