p@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"message":"e2e: search a word of the transcript and open the line at its moment\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7f44aef846042ce257c26bade6e4ef0e32f78bbf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/trees/7f44aef846042ce257c26bade6e4ef0e32f78bbf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/commits/bcd1dd8dab0c0f9865d41f146ccb2fa6d8a5568c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/bcd1dd8dab0c0f9865d41f146ccb2fa6d8a5568c","node_id":"C_kwDOU52059oAKGJjZDFkZDhkYWIwYzBmOTg2NWQ0MWYxNDZjY2IyZmE2ZDhhNTU2OGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/3f1a9800390b7774d468031901708c63fff18d42","sha":"3f1a9800390b7774d468031901708c63fff18d42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/3f1a9800390b7774d468031901708c63fff18d42"}],"sha":"bcd1dd8dab0c0f9865d41f146ccb2fa6d8a5568c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/bcd1dd8dab0c0f9865d41f146ccb2fa6d8a5568c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/3f1a9800390b7774d468031901708c63fff18d42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:45:58Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T11:45:58Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"message":"Search page: every line of every call, matches marked, each line opens its moment\n\n/search with the words and the language in the address (so a page can be\nshared and stepped back to), a page at a time; a hit links to\n/recordings/:id?t=<seconds>. Matches come as <mark> tags from likho-search\nand are rendered by splitting on them, never as HTML. SDK v0.2.0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5b71cbec02fb978f4f9a5a36076c769732f4ff16","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/trees/5b71cbec02fb978f4f9a5a36076c769732f4ff16"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/commits/3f1a9800390b7774d468031901708c63fff18d42","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/3f1a9800390b7774d468031901708c63fff18d42","node_id":"C_kwDOU52059oAKDNmMWE5ODAwMzkwYjc3NzRkNDY4MDMxOTAxNzA4YzYzZmZmMThkNDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/a23eabcb827b434d362a7961a5a802c7b8a144d1","sha":"a23eabcb827b434d362a7961a5a802c7b8a144d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/a23eabcb827b434d362a7961a5a802c7b8a144d1"}],"sha":"3f1a9800390b7774d468031901708c63fff18d42","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/3f1a9800390b7774d468031901708c63fff18d42"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/a23eabcb827b434d362a7961a5a802c7b8a144d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T09:22:43Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T09:22:43Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"message":"Load apps with use() so no component is made during render; retry really retries\n\nThe remote loader kept a lazy() component per app, which the react-hooks\nstatic-components rule rejects (and lazy() never forgets a failed load, so\n\"Try again\" could not work). Now a cached promise per module is read with\nuse() inside one static component; \"Try again\" forgets the failed attempt\nand loads the module again. Tested, including the retry.\n\nAlso: the flat react-hooks ESLint config, which the CI run needs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"081bfb13fb00423ef3229062e21158fe7254b91c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/trees/081bfb13fb00423ef3229062e21158fe7254b91c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/commits/a23eabcb827b434d362a7961a5a802c7b8a144d1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/a23eabcb827b434d362a7961a5a802c7b8a144d1","node_id":"C_kwDOU52059oAKGEyM2VhYmNiODI3YjQzNGQzNjJhNzk2MWE1YTgwMmM3YjhhMTQ0ZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/34f1395d9f2fb717b74f05a7ec8a5f8758faa9a0","sha":"34f1395d9f2fb717b74f05a7ec8a5f8758faa9a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/34f1395d9f2fb717b74f05a7ec8a5f8758faa9a0"}],"sha":"a23eabcb827b434d362a7961a5a802c7b8a144d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/a23eabcb827b434d362a7961a5a802c7b8a144d1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/34f1395d9f2fb717b74f05a7ec8a5f8758faa9a0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:51:26Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T07:51:26Z","email":"sandeep@softechproducts.com","name":"Sandeep"},"message":"Web shell: sign-in, navigation, theme, home, vocabulary, settings; loads the apps\n\nThe frame of the web app. Reads /mfe/manifest.json, registers each app with\nthe Module Federation runtime and mounts it under its route; react,\nreact-router, the query cache, likho-ui and likho-web-sdk are shared\nsingletons. 6 unit tests; a Playwright run drives the whole product in\nChrome through the gateway (sign in, upload, live transcript, player).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dbf8619aa3d7802288be12d70d5c8bfb6452af68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/trees/dbf8619aa3d7802288be12d70d5c8bfb6452af68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/git/commits/34f1395d9f2fb717b74f05a7ec8a5f8758faa9a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commit/34f1395d9f2fb717b74f05a7ec8a5f8758faa9a0","node_id":"C_kwDOU52059oAKDM0ZjEzOTVkOWYyZmI3MTdiNzRmMDVhN2VjOGE1Zjg3NThmYWE5YTA","parents":[],"sha":"34f1395d9f2fb717b74f05a7ec8a5f8758faa9a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits/34f1395d9f2fb717b74f05a7ec8a5f8758faa9a0"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/likho-ai/likho-web-shell/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=4ae62649f42b51fade365cd6df8f8413c8c60e44&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T15%3A34%3A51.431Z"}');
