n- client-direct Firestore API on papers/ (college tests) and paperTemplates/\n  (platform templates, cross-college readable by rule)\n- 2-step wizard (details -> sections) + confirmation screen with the section\n  table; proctoring stays on hold (D3)\n- My Tests: edit / duplicate / schedule-when-ready / archive, plus\n  \"Create from template\": browse or look up a shared test code, review the\n  pattern, duplicate into your own college (1 read + 1 write, questions are\n  embedded)\n- routes under /faculty and /admin, role gate assessment.authorTests\n  (faculty, hod, admin, employee; principal and mentor stay out) with\n  permissions tests and nav entries in every affected role nav\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ea02a70a639d11ab0826a409d2a2153d7b3785da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/ea02a70a639d11ab0826a409d2a2153d7b3785da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/9b7cdd31f452d315a941eb36ae9e73efa1844ec0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://ap