},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/4414afe00c0a3ab5e268548148ddee0decab7465/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:35:58Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:35:58Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"Phase A: Placement Prep joins the unified student nav\n\nOne Vriddhi Phase A — the practice pillar becomes visible inside the one\nplatform instead of living behind shared URLs only:\n\n- New ''Placement Prep'' entry in the Learning hub / sidebar / More sheet,\n  opening the existing /prep viewer. The viewer is college-scoped\n  automatically: prep endpoints resolve the signed-in student''s college\n  from the token and apply its visibility panel (master switch + hidden\n  companies), so hidden colleges/companies stay hidden on deep links too.\n- Nav gate mirrors the Coding Lab pattern but follows company-prep\n  semantics: visible unless the master switch is EXPLICITLY off (server\n  default is enabled), fail-closed on read errors / missing college.\n- Firestore rules: students can read their own colleges/{id}/config/prep\n  for nav gating; writes tightened to superadmin-only, matching the\n  /prep/companies/settings API that manages it (courses/codingLab parity).\n- Rules tests updated (student read allowed, cross-college denied,\n  college-staff writes now denied, superadmin writes pass) and nav-model\n  tests cover the new entry + /prep deep-link resolution.\n\nNo new Cloud Run services, no new collections, no assessment changes.\nTests: functions 1248/1248, root 710->712, tsc + vite build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b64a6e29cde4f1daa4da72e24f8849b206ccaa85","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/b64a6e29