p hub entry reusing\n  the published-only prep viewer + college visibility panel, a\n  three-pillar Today strip on the dashboard, result->practice->learning\n  cross-links, and My Journey as the single progress spine. Zero new\n  Cloud Run services; no writes added.\n- ASSESSMENT_PORTAL_REDESIGN.md marked PARKED / future reference per\n  the same decision.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"03505bf805824a5dbbc292be96cac4df6a0724bf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/03505bf805824a5dbbc292be96cac4df6a0724bf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/fb52c2ee3a387efb7506681d8caa4b1d5cf3fbbc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/fb52c2ee3a387efb7506681d8caa4b1d5cf3fbbc","node_id":"C_kwDOU53JZNoAKGZiNTJjMmVlM2EzODdlZmI3NTA2NjgxZDhjYWE0YjFkNWNmM2ZiYmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/3001fcaab4b61eca4676bcb4f66d0d35c2579c75","sha":"3001fcaab4b61eca4676bcb4f66d0d35c2579c75","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/3001fcaab4b61eca4676bcb4f66d0d35c2579c75"}],"sha":"fb52c2ee3a387efb7506681d8caa4b1d5cf3fbbc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/fb52c2ee3a387efb7506681d8caa4b1d5cf3fbbc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/3001fcaab4b61eca4676bcb4f66d0d35c2579c75/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:48:44Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T10:48:44Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"Assessment portal design v3: PrepInsta-referenced, desktop-only, cost-engineered\n\nAbsorbs the PrepInsta student-end workflow as the interaction contract and\nrebuilds it for Vriddhi:\n- Full target student journey: login modes (account / email OTP / exam\n  passcode), My Tests dashboard, instructions + environment gate, section\n  countdown, desktop 3-pane player (palette grey/green/rose, keyboard\n  shortcuts, autosave, mark/clear), section-lock submits, final review,\n  idempotent submission.\n- Desktop-only decision enforced at test entry (no mobile fallback);\n  split-pane coding workspace with unlimited dry runs + capped graded runs\n  (default 25/problem), language selection, runner stays pluggable while\n  Judge0 is excluded.\n- Proctoring as a configurable warning ladder with human review queue,\n  grace-mode reconnect, and server-authoritative crash resume.\n- Read/write & cost engineering as a first-class requirement: debounced\n  answer flush (~12-18 writes/attempt vs 100+ naive), lazy per-section\n  chunk delivery (~9 reads/attempt), drive-scale estimate ~INR 3-4 per\n  1,000-student drive, zero new Cloud Run services.\n- Engine change list is additive only (sectionState, flush endpoint,\n  proctor config, OTP/passcode routes on the shared api function).\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6038819489a38e74b1682079340eee1d31184565","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/6038819489a38e74b1682079340eee1d31184565"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/3001fcaab4b61eca4676bcb4f66d0d35c2579c75","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813