Assignments module behind a college-level toggle, reusing the\n  existing colleges/{id}/config/* feature-switch pattern (Resume Builder /\n  Coding Lab): colleges/{collegeId}/config/modules, defaults ON, explicit\n  enabled:false is the only off switch.\n- Server-side enforcement in the 10 assignment callables + assignment\n  analytics (failed-precondition with a user-safe message); settings\n  GET/PUT ride on the shared api Express function so no new Cloud Run\n  services are created under the current CPU quota.\n- UI: student nav/hub/dashboard hide Assignments when off (fail-open read),\n  deep-link guards on StudentAssignments / FacultyAssignments /\n  AssignmentAnalytics, faculty+admin nav entries hidden, new Optional\n  Modules panel in college Settings and superadmin college overview.\n- Firestore rules: students of a college can read config/modules\n  (nav gating); writes stay with superadmin or the college''s\n  admin/principal/hod. Rules test added alongside the codingLab test.\n- Docs: assessment portal redesign proposal for technical colleges\n  (skill-based assessments, no question-paper module) and the\n  quota-compatible deployment plan (no scaling changes applied).\n\nJudge0/runStudentCode untouched; Admission Center functions untouched\n(on hold). Baselines: 1243->1248 functions tests, 709->710 root tests,\nall green; functions + frontend builds pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"23fdab22be56fb7cfea8f97ac188caeb498c042f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/23fdab22be56fb7cfea8f97ac188caeb498c042f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/8a801418b49f48ca5de3c0712d76f5b784d964ea","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.git