github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/45094e90658f889e233d7e86d0151c644451bd57","node_id":"C_kwDOU53JZNoAKDQ1MDk0ZTkwNjU4Zjg4OWUyMzNkN2U4NmQwMTUxYzY0NDQ1MWJkNTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/411c0c43682eb36eb72334f4985f94a2489ae63e","sha":"411c0c43682eb36eb72334f4985f94a2489ae63e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/411c0c43682eb36eb72334f4985f94a2489ae63e"}],"sha":"45094e90658f889e233d7e86d0151c644451bd57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/45094e90658f889e233d7e86d0151c644451bd57"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/411c0c43682eb36eb72334f4985f94a2489ae63e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T05:03:13Z","email":"dev@vriddhi.local","name":"Vriddhi Dev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T05:20:25Z","email":"dev@vriddhi.local","name":"Vriddhi Dev"},"message":"feat(scheme): add B.E./B.Tech scheme packs and remove University Exam from Principal\n\nExtends the existing G1 scheme-pack model with an optional engineering block\nrather than forking evaluation logic:\n\n- types: SchemeEngineeringRules (course-type weightages, relative grading,\n  paper template, OBE attainment) plus semesterEndExam.scaleFrom\n- presets: VTU_2022_BE_BTECH and AUTONOMOUS_ENGINEERING_5050\n- utils/engineeringScheme.ts: SEE scaling, SEE eligibility, heads of passing,\n  relative grading with an absolute floor, NBA attainment, paper generation\n- permissions: universityExam.manage/view/publish, obe.attainment,\n  engineering.schemePacks; /admin/exam-management now gated, which removes it\n  from the Principal''s route access and sidebar in one data change\n- ci: new scheme job that installs the tsx loader only\n\n56 assertions pass (19 existing engine tests unchanged, 27 new, 10 permissions).","tree":{"sha":"111c4672d813a428f1cad704