08: lessons 1.1-8.3 with labs, journals and Indian\n  small-business running examples; per-module quiz banks (5 per lesson +\n  10 advanced module-assessment questions each, 60% gate)\n- projects: PB1 SEO audit, PB2 content engine, PB3 campaign plan,\n  PB4 analytics dashboard, capstone integrated campaign + Demo Day pitch\n- assessments: final-assessment blueprint (60 MCQs + 2 scenarios, 20%),\n  rubrics, certification policy; weights quizzes 15 / projects 28 /\n  capstone 30 / final 20 / journal 7\n- facilitator-guide.md: weekly rhythm, calendar, module notes, tool\n  landscape, difficulties and adaptations\n- modules/01-foundations/slides.json: in-app slide walkthrough pilot\n- README: digital-marketing row in the pack table\n- render-check: scope the assignment-panel harness selectors to the\n  manifest''s card so the new (alphabetically first) pack does not\n  intercept the clicks\n\nValidated: npm run validate:courses (2 packs ok), tsc --noEmit,\ntest:unit 528/528, test:render:courses 60/60, check:dead-code, build,\nfunctions test:unit 1030/1030\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"0dac442fd49fd0ea1707ad1c862e4f8553f4c108","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/0dac442fd49fd0ea1707ad1c862e4f8553f4c108"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/b389698f8cd9609d583abd9b0e398a843717a7b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"htt