48dbddd25037422b0afa2c1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/028649d3eda99b1b48dbddd25037422b0afa2c1a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/86e730f11e53ca902e2615af689613f99b4aa600/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:58:27Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:58:27Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"feat(pdf): server-rendered attendance register as text PDF, browser path kept as fallback (item 4.3, part 2)\n\nThe first document off the client rasteriser, chosen because it is the most-used\nexport and a plain table.\n\n- functions/src/reports/attendanceRegister.ts (pure, 18 tests): validate and clamp\n  the posted report (4 sheets / 8000 rows / 16 columns / 300 chars per cell, rows\n  padded or trimmed to the header width, every cell escaped) BEFORE a 2 GiB Chrome\n  instance is asked to render it; landscape A4 HTML with a repeating thead and\n  client column weights preserved so server and browser sheets look like the same\n  document.\n- POST /attendance/register/pdf on the pdf function (api + bare prefixes, staff\n  roles, reportPdfLimiter 10/min). It renders what it is handed and reads nothing\n  from Firestore — no second copy of the attendance visibility rules.\n- src/shared/utils/serverReportPdf.ts (12 tests): 503 cold renderer, 429, 400/401,\n  SPA-shell 200, empty body, timeout and dead network all become\n  { kind: ''fallback'' } — downloadAttendanceReport then draws the sheet with jsPDF\n  exactly as before. Nothing in the new path can fail a download that used to work.\n- docs/HANDOFF_IMPLEMENTATION §12.1b records the operator parity check that the\n  plan requires before the client path is dropped for this document, and §12 notes\n  that 2.3 needs no code.\n\nfunctions 995 -> 1013, root 485 -> 497, render 382/382, both tsc clean, build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"36c6646b8b71780636e42d0bc6ef1bd32e011f27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/36c6646b8b71780636e42d0bc6ef1bd32e011f27"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/86e730f11e53ca902e2615af689613f99b4aa600","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/86e730f11e53ca902e2615af689613f99b4aa600","node_id":"C_kwDOU53JZNoAKDg2ZTczMGYxMWU1M2NhOTAyZTI2MTVhZjY4OTYxM2Y5OWI0YWE2MDA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/bb1fe7eb320c775f20ac1da3a1dca4631525bcf3","sha":"bb1fe7eb320c775f20ac1da3a1dca4631525bcf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/bb1fe7eb320c775f20ac1da3a1dca4631525bcf3"}],"sha":"86e730f11e53ca902e2615af689613f99b4aa600","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/86e730f11e53ca902e2615af689613f99b4aa600"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/bb1fe7eb320c775f20ac1da3a1dca4631525bcf3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:54:30Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:54:30Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"perf(pdf): one lazy entry point for jspdf + html2canvas (item 4.3, part 1)\n\n584 kB of PDF libraries used to be preloaded by index.html for every visitor,\nincluding the ones who never download a PDF — one static import was enough to pull\nthe chunk into the entry graph, and Vite added a modulepreload link for it.\n\n- src/shared/utils/pdfRuntime.ts is now the single loader: dynamic import() inside\n  the click that needs a PDF, cached, and a failed load is NOT cached so a flaky\n  connection retries instead of failing for the session. preloadPdfLibs() for\n  hover-warming.\n- All six consumers routed through it (pdfGenerator, attendanceExport, financePdf,\n  labelsPdf, reportPdf, noDuesApi). downloadAttendanceReport is async now; its\n  three call sites await inside their existing try/catch.\n- vite.config.ts: the pdf chunk is filtered out of modulePreload, otherwise Vite\n  emits the preload link anyway and the saving is zero.\n- src/shared/utils/pdfRuntime.test.ts (6, in test:unit): cache/retry contract plus a\n  source-tree guard so no future file can reintroduce a static import.\n\nVerified in the build: before, index.html preloaded /assets/pdf-*.js and the entry\nchunk imported it; after, zero references — the chunk is fetched by\nimport(\"./pdf-*.js\") at the moment of use.\n\ndocs/HANDOFF_IMPLEMENTATION_2026-09-25.md §12 records what is deliberately left:\nthe per-document move to server text PDFs (Chrome per export, parity needs human\neyes) with a recommended order.\n\nroot 479 -> 485, render 382/382, tsc clean, vite build clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6588e6888d42da75b89e3812729418b67511469","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/f6588e6888d42da75b89e3812729418b67511469"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/bb1fe7eb320c775f20ac1da3a1dca4631525bcf3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/bb1fe7eb320c775f20ac1da3a1dca4631525bcf3","node_id":"C_kwDOU53JZNoAKGJiMWZlN2ViMzIwYzc3NWYyMGFjMWRhM2ExZGNhNDYzMTUyNWJjZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/a6fefc05f1448c0189d0f37bd3426f2e8b8866d5","sha":"a6fefc05f1448c0189d0f37bd3426f2e8b8866d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/a6fefc05f1448c0189d0f37bd3426f2e8b8866d5"}],"sha":"bb1fe7eb320c775f20ac1da3a1dca4631525bcf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/bb1fe7eb320c775f20ac1da3a1dca4631525bcf3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/a6fefc05f1448c0189d0f37bd3426f2e8b8866d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:48:39Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:48:39Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"feat(resume): Placement Pack extensions — cover letter, LinkedIn About, interview prep, readiness (item 4.2)\n\n- functions/src/resume/extras.ts (pure, 29 tests): prompt builders that carry the\n  candidate''s own facts and forbid invented ones; sanitisers that reject empty or\n  refusal output, strip a fence wherever it is plus preamble/chat sign-offs, remove\n  unfilled [placeholders] (the failure a recruiter notices), flag length, and drop\n  unusable/duplicate interview questions; a server-side readiness score for the\n  placement cell; CSV cell escaping.\n- Routes: POST /resume/cover-letter, /resume/linkedin-about and\n  /resume/interview-questions — gated by the existing resumeBuilder flags, spending\n  the SAME aiCallsPerStudent allowance (reserved before the model call), returned as\n  aiRemaining, and cached by the 4.1 engine on content-addressing keys only.\n- GET /resume/admin/placement-stats (+ ?format=csv): one row per saved resume with\n  readiness, band, gaps and downloads, summarised. The score is computed and stored\n  server-side on every PUT /resume/me (resumes/{uid}.placement) — a dashboard number\n  the browser cannot inflate. Older documents are scored on the fly.\n- Client: PlacementPackPanel on the student resume page (editable output, never\n  auto-written into the resume; allowance shown; the server''s own refusal message\n  kept verbatim) + resumeService functions.\n- Docs: docs/RESUME_BUILDER.md gains §6b (routes, tiers, cache keys, flags, sanitisers,\n  placement stats, and what is NOT included yet).\n\nfunctions 995/995, root 479/479, render 366 -> 382, vite build ok, both tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"f15373d6a9de811a83eacd9f04a1a061b27dfd0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/f15373d