/api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/22dcb9c37d34fcd1d18d344509997938aeee2ba8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:30:50Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:30:50Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"feat(prep): reviewed model answers and quick-revision MCQs from past papers (items 3.4, 3.5)\n\n- functions/src/prepModelAnswers.ts: prompt builders (answer sized by marks,\n  MCQ set with four plausible options), answer sanitiser that rejects refusals\n  and empty output, strips code fences/preambles/chat sign-offs and flags a\n  stub for its marks, MCQ parser that drops bad or duplicate items instead of\n  failing the set, and the doc-id rules shared with the client. 29 tests.\n- Routes: POST /papers/answers/generate (superadmin, <=25 per call, skips\n  already-answered questions, cached via the 4.1 engine), GET /papers/answers\n  (published for all, drafts for the reviewer), POST /papers/answers/review\n  (the ONLY way content becomes visible), and the same trio for\n  /papers/mcq-sets. Paper detail now carries its published answers.\n- Client: answers render collapsed under their question with the\n  ''Model answer - AI-generated, reviewed'' label; quick-revision sets are\n  answered inline and reveal the option plus the explanation; a superadmin-only\n  review strip generates, publishes and rejects. A draft never reaches a\n  student''s browser — the server filters it.\n- Rules: prep_paper_answers and prep_mcq_sets published-only reads, drafts for\n  superadmins, no client writes (+ rules test).\n- render-check: 334 -> 347 checks (student view hides drafts and the strip,\n  reviewer sees both, publishing calls the review endpoint with the draft id).\n\nfunctions 966/966, root 473/473, render 347/347, vite build ok, tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bac91bb74022ad380d801686d406916e12922cb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/bac91bb74022ad380d801686d406916e12922cb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/22dcb9c37d34fcd1d18d344509997938aeee2ba8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/22dcb9c37d34fcd1d18d344509997938aeee2ba8","node_id":"C_kwDOU53JZNoAKDIyZGNiOWMzN2QzNGZjZDFkMThkMzQ0NTA5OTk3OTM4YWVlZTJiYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/51622acc5fa2673ee9528f7c215616c7b366cf18","sha":"51622acc5fa2673ee9528f7c215616c7b366cf18","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/51622acc5fa2673ee9528f7c215616c7b366cf18"}],"sha":"22dcb9c37d34fcd1d18d344509997938aeee2ba8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/22dcb9c37d34fcd1d18d344509997938aeee2ba8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/51622acc5fa2673ee9528f7c215616c7b366cf18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:18:35Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:18:35Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"feat(ai): shared content cache so identical generations are paid for once (item 4.1)\n\n- functions/src/ai/contentEngine.ts: generateContentWithCache({kind, key, tier,\n  prompt, parse}) over aiContentCache/{sha256(kind|key|model|promptVersion)}.\n  Model id and prompt version are part of the hash, so a model change or a\n  prompt rewrite invalidates by itself. Cache read/write/counter failures are\n  misses, never failed requests. 21 tests (hit/miss/stale, key sensitivity,\n  unparseable stored content, failing deps, tier-fallback storage).\n- Wrapped the two uncached high-volume generators: Prep Studio draft generation\n  (provider cascade stays inside the generator) and question generation (keyed\n  by course/module/unit/chapter/type/difficulty/language/count/marks plus the\n  operator''s extra instruction). Study packs already had ai_study_materials —\n  no double cache.\n- Cache counters live in platform/aiCacheStats and are folded into\n  platform/stats by refreshPlatformStats; the superadmin dashboard shows the hit\n  rate next to the data-freshness label. Rules: aiContentCache denied to every\n  client (+ rules test).\n\nfunctions 937/937, root 473/473, render 334/334, vite build ok, tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9a9c281e6ab2e810b33d6e22aec129438da207e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/9a9c281e6ab2e810b33d6e22aec129438da207e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/51622acc5fa2673ee9528f7c215616c7b366cf18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{