picker and empty state).\n\nfunctions 916/916, root 473/473, render 334/334, vite build ok, tsc clean.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7eb42d3633893250f618b1a5b8df1da4c44d9277","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/7eb42d3633893250f618b1a5b8df1da4c44d9277"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/cde8a3321adb411887225e615b27fc0410dc4193","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/cde8a3321adb411887225e615b27fc0410dc4193","node_id":"C_kwDOU53JZNoAKGNkZThhMzMyMWFkYjQxMTg4NzIyNWU2MTViMjdmYzA0MTBkYzQxOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/2b4f7cf9b581ca1c817302c5af17b257fdecd0b5","sha":"2b4f7cf9b581ca1c817302c5af17b257fdecd0b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/2b4f7cf9b581ca1c817302c5af17b257fdecd0b5"}],"sha":"cde8a3321adb411887225e615b27fc0410dc4193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/cde8a3321adb411887225e615b27fc0410dc4193"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/2b4f7cf9b581ca1c817302c5af17b257fdecd0b5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:01:52Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T19:01:52Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"perf(cost+ux): immutable assets, snapshot dashboards, attendance summary (items 2.2, 2.4, 3.1, 3.2)\n\n2.2 — hosting cache headers + chunk-reload guard\n- firebase.json: /assets/** is `public, max-age=31536000, immutable` (Vite\n  fingerprints the names), root /*.js keeps no-store, /index.html revalidates.\n  Before this, every visit re-downloaded ~9 MB of JS/CSS (egress ₹3,936/yr).\n- src/shared/pwa/chunkReload.ts + main.tsx: one-shot `vite:preloadError` reload\n  (sessionStorage-guarded, never loops), because a header rule matches the\n  REQUEST path and deep links keep Firebase''s default caching (clause A9).\n\n2.4 — superadmin numbers are a snapshot, not a scan\n- functions/src/platformStats.ts: `refreshPlatformStats` (every 15 min) writes\n  platform/stats from count() aggregations; a failed tick keeps the last good\n  document instead of zeroing it.\n- getDashboardStats reads that ONE document, falling back to counting when it is\n  missing or older than an hour; the whole-collection scans are gone (dead code\n  removed). Returns updatedAt/source so the page can say how old the numbers are.\n- useSuperAdmin: dashboard 10 min, health 5 min, logs 5 min.\n- SuperAdminDashboard shows \"Updated …\" + Refresh (clause A11);\n  superadmin/utils/freshness.ts + tests.\n- rules: platform/{doc} superadmin-read, no client writes (+ rules tests).\n\n3.1 — attendance summary document\n- functions/src/attendanceSummary.ts: pure delta/rebuild maths, an\n  onDocumentWritten trigger with an exactly-once guard (lastEventId, clause A7),\n  a nightly reconcile that rebuilds only drifted students, and a superadmin\n  backfill callable that aggregates AFTER an import instead of hammering one\n  document (clause A8). 19 unit tests.\n- Student dashboard reads ONE document (~600 reads → 1). AttendancePage keeps\n  the raw rows; the raw query is the fallback whenever a summary is missing (C3).\n- attended = present + onDuty + late, identical to the raw path, so no student''s\n  percentage moves for the sessions inside the old window; the mapping is\n  Firebase-free and unit-tested for exactly that.\n- rules: student reads their own summary, staff read their college''s, no client\n  writes (+ rules tests).\n\n3.2 — admin dashboard headline counts via aggregation\n- fetchDashboardCounts() uses count() for students/assessments/scores. Those\n  totals were derived from at most 500 downloaded rows, so they were also\n  silently short for any college above 500 students; the row fetches stay for\n  the lists and charts.\n\ngates: functions tsc clean, functions test:unit 884/884; root tsc clean, root\ntest:unit 473/473; render 317/317; vite build ok. Rules tests still need Java.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"bebd4dee315881ec04d386a96236dd5b41db32de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/bebd4dee315881ec04d386a96236dd5b41db32de"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/2b4f7cf9b581ca1c817302c5af17b257fdecd0b5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/2b4f7cf9b581ca1c817302c5af17b257fdecd0b5","node_id":"C_kwDOU53JZNoAKDJiNGY3Y2Y5YjU4MWNhMWM4MTczMDJjNWFmMTdiMjU3ZmRlY2QwYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/468f22dcbb9c087d19f9c1140c1924994101cd6a","sha":"468f22dcbb9c087d19f9c1140c1924994101cd6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/468f22dcbb9c087d19f9c1140c1924994101cd6a"}],"sha":"2b4f7cf9b581ca1c817302c5af17b257fdecd0b5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/2b4f7cf9b581ca1c817302c5af17b257fdecd0b5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commits/468f22dcbb9c087d19f9c1140c1924994101cd6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:40:41Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-25T18:40:41Z","email":"317562256+smanoj1813-collab@users.noreply.github.com","name":"smanoj1813-collab"},"message":"feat(ai): tiered Gemini models with in-tier fallback, telemetry and a canary\n\nItem 2.1 of docs/HANDOFF_OPTIMISATION_2026-09-25.md (clauses A1-A3).\n\nThree routes called gemini-1.5-flash, shut down 29 Sep 2025 — study material,\nAI chat and prep drafts were broken unless a DeepSeek/OpenAI key existed. The\nfix is structural, not a find-and-replace:\n\n- config/aiModels.ts is now the ONLY place a Gemini model id appears. Tiers are\n  ordered lists (fast: chat/study material/prep drafts; quality: paper parsing,\n  grading, question generation, paper import) and each entry carries its\n  shutdown date. Env overrides GEMINI_MODEL_FAST / GEMINI_MODEL_QUALITY accept\n  a comma-separated list; RESUME_AI_MODEL and QUESTION_IMPORT_AI_MODEL keep\n  working as call-site overrides.\n- generateWithGeminiFallback() moves to the next model in the tier only when\n  the error says the MODEL is unusable (404 / not-found / not-supported /\n  retired); a quota or network error is not retried, so no call is spent twice.\n- readGeminiUsage() counts thoughtsTokenCount as billable output and reports\n  cachedContentTokenCount separately; ai_usage gains tokensThinking/tokensCached\n  and the model that actually answered is recorded on the version, the grading\n  suggestion and the paper-import audit row.\n- aiModelCanary (daily 06:30 IST) asks each tier''s first model for one word and\n  writes platform/aiModelCanary; a refused model logs \"TIER MODEL IS GONE\" with\n  the env var to set, so the next retirement is a log line, not an outage.\n- test/aiModels.test.ts (18 tests) pins all of it, including a source scan that\n  fails the suite if a gemini-<number> literal reappears outside the registry,\n  and a rules test proving platform/aiModelCanary stays server-only.\n\nThe DeepSeek/OpenAI provider chains are untouched — a model-level fallback now\nhappens inside Gemini before them.\n\ngates: functions tsc clean; functions test:unit 865/865; root tsc clean; root\ntest:unit 461/461; render check 317/317; vite build ok.\n\nCo-authored-by: arena-agent <297053741+arena-agent@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"fbdf3c306561b70184231d9317a3d871446e85ce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/trees/fbdf3c306561b70184231d9317a3d871446e85ce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/git/commits/468f22dcbb9c087d19f9c1140c1924994101cd6a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/317562256?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab","id":317562256,"login":"smanoj1813-collab","node_id":"U_kgDOEu2dkA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smanoj1813-collab","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/smanoj1813-collab/Vriddhi-engineering/commit/468f22dcbb9c087d19f9c1140c1924994101cd6a","node_id":"C_kwDOU53JZNoAKDQ2OGYyMmRjYmI5YzA4N2QxOWY5YzExNDBjMTkyN