s://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zaid-Takieddin","id":59053451,"login":"Zaid-Takieddin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDUzNDUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZaidTakieddin/passport-wizard/commits/a4bc27154ff7d4e9fb25bfd9f03ea3c21d336c45/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T13:32:36Z","email":"zaidtakieddin@gmail.com","name":"ZaidTakieddin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T13:32:36Z","email":"zaidtakieddin@gmail.com","name":"ZaidTakieddin"},"message":"feat: implement the host wizard\n\nStep 1 renders the federated PassportForm, and Next stays disabled until it reports valid: true. Step 2 adds the host''s ID form (ID number and one of 10 nationalities), and Submit stays disabled until both forms are valid. Back restores the passport data through initialValue and keeps the ID values. Submit builds the payload in the documented shape, logs it and shows it with a Start over option. Wizard state lives in one reducer with guarded transitions, and the host relies on the remote''s valid flag instead of re-checking passport rules.","tree":{"sha":"265bd0df72e1afd3da49885ff74d43057b1922f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZaidTakieddin/passport-wizard/git/trees/265bd0df72e1afd3da49885ff74d43057b1922f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZaidTakieddin/passport-wizard/git/commits/a4bc27154ff7d4e9fb25bfd9f03ea3c21d336c45","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature"