lowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Zaid-Takieddin","id":59053451,"login":"Zaid-Takieddin","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU5MDUzNDUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Zaid-Takieddin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZaidTakieddin/passport-wizard/commits/491c1c2f2b51c7102ee3c15dbcf6680aca9f8d36/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:38:39Z","email":"zaidtakieddin@gmail.com","name":"ZaidTakieddin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-03T12:38:39Z","email":"zaidtakieddin@gmail.com","name":"ZaidTakieddin"},"message":"feat: implement PassportForm in the remote\n\nAdds the six required passport fields with continuous validation and inline errors, driven by one Zod schema through React Hook Form. The form reports { valid, data } to its host on mount and on every change. The document is checked (one PDF, PNG or JPEG file, up to 5 MB) and stored as { fileName, mimeType, base64 }, and initialValue restores the form after navigating back. Shared types live in a new types-only workspace package, passport-contract. The host shows the reported validity until the wizard replaces it.","tree":{"sha":"1081e9ea8f5e425b26bd962197a500b59b95eaf9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZaidTakieddin/passport-wizard/git/trees/1081e9ea8f5e425b26bd962197a500b59b95eaf9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZaidTakieddin/passport-wizard/git/commits/491c1c2f2b51c7102ee3c15dbcf6680aca9f8d36","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":