pilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: use remote auth container builds\n\nCorrect the red assertion after proxy testing showed the approved feed lacks required locked packages. ACR remote build preserves the pinned Containerfile while removing the local Docker registry dependency.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test: exclude local azd state from validation\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: ignore local azd validation state\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3a330f75c1034b91412bec6b580dca7074d5d3dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diberry/aca-3/git/trees/3a330f75c1034b91412bec6b580dca7074d5d3dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/diberry/aca-3/git/commits/7134a437f6e775d4d4c45c51304b82384728e2bc","verification":{"payload":"tree 3a330f75c1034b91412bec6b580dca7074d5d3dc\nparent 490f25add40cf249798b48f53b816850737f8568\nauthor Dina Berry (MSFT) <diberry@microsoft.com> 1791241564 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791241564 -0700\n\nFix azd Auth/Shell packaging with remote builds (#14)\n\n* test: require proxy-safe container bootstrap\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: use remote auth container builds\n\nCorrect the red assertion after proxy testing showed the approved feed lacks required locked packages. ACR remote build preserves the pinned Containerfile while removing the local Docker registry dependency.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* test: exclude local azd state from validation\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: ignore local azd validation state\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users