://api.github.com/users/claudioed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-planning/commits/e22ac4929238ab11114b8a858d2b1332fd917d22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:52:19Z","email":"claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com","name":"Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-04T13:52:19Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve capacity by window coverage, not exact window match (#12)\n\n* feat: resolve step capacity by window coverage (FindCovering, newest-wins, per-type shadowing)\n\nA constraint registered for window C applies to a planning window W when\nC covers W. Live labor rows from one ShiftPlanCommitted share a start time\nbut differ in end time per path, so exact-window lookup could never resolve\na real path. REST GET/POST /process-capacities keep exact-key semantics.\n\n* test(bdd): live-shaped coverage scenarios for path capacity and capacity plan\n\n* test(integration): FindCovering ordering/boundaries and live-shaped round trip on Postgres\n\n* docs: ADR 0003 window coverage; rules and gremlins measurement","tree":{"sha":"8e827f9885cea6798e98e63b463a915fbc356d73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-planning/git/trees/8e827f9885cea6798e98e63b463a915fbc356d73"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/IQVO/warehouse-planning/git/commits/e22ac4929238ab11114b8a858d2b1332fd917d22","verification":{"payload":"tree 8e827f9885cea6798e98e63b463a915fbc356d73\nparent 10624542c6b588390e366828189634466a341181\nauthor Claudio Eduardo de Oliveira <claudioed.oliveira@gmail.com> 1791121939 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791121939 -0300\n\nfix: resolve capacity by window coverage, not exact window match (#12)\n\n* feat: resolve step capacity by window coverage (FindCovering, newest-wins, per-type shadowing)\n\nA constraint registered for window C applies to a planning window W when\nC covers W. Live labor rows from one ShiftPlanCommitted share a start time\nbut differ in end time per path, so exact-window lookup could never resolve\na real path. REST GET/POST /process-capacities keep exact-key semantics.\n\n* test(bdd): live-shaped coverage scenarios for path capacity and capacity plan\n\n* test(integration): FindCovering ordering/boundaries and live-shaped round trip on Postgres\n\n* docs: ADR 0003 window coverage; rules and gremlins measurement","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqwloTCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwBUQAJOzBIBAvHt6tdNrMiwtKIQN\nRbkP9fDOLeNOCfDka9JVWNfGQalk3LDY5weg9u0MmmTapwbdTFI1xL80GLl+8I9H\nWAl18d82D6xi5gu5BL00W4wG8djRhDF5dtmsGuK8ag6DPVoLTICd48mKneb8cjJ9\ndMa9tf3WUlIhPudMGIEBFwAlV0QgrV9NKU/rIf5dYVX38BxooN0rpgmD7AOrQkeP\nceVwwcVYLtSnWfT+xFsqsJUO7GPCcI4GYGKU80IPLbdNHLx/v59gB0QUCFsTKhhg\nhFFziZSZaZ01aRV7K6DhpRLkd6QJrDz3sBD8GZ4jlLQG8JF2WxYVB2H0aqGtCv1P\nRsUPHFkDPhK4n1TzcG3jn8L3LezgYl3X7HtnmlzMUCYmWej6gvAAPvb9nEJx3Dlc\nEFu3t1wqzTY/k0fXIVCSynVz4H6gvOP341k2y51kHErcw/Xby+84XXBxQgkkXrF4\n6CPyGKUGVquuM+7A31C5+0ToQhI+MBQtti+qep/CG6KUyFQSX/2tc8S3AFEx/g7w\n+mADQORTxsCI1Wf5OmGHUie9/EeWZX2sjyjmu6/KuYcP/1Iup2csZbi1ei/qnclg\nXxpw7SbJHoaETM3fBEuxQKkMKWFk+tdB3v9jmo2bMtyWUOEjUlfWHwfju+lpsHLY\n1ZfqIVHVmeiB4/DuNxi7\n=KB/3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-10-04T13:52:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/u