ller1","id":318769617,"login":"vonmiller1","node_id":"U_kgDOEwAJ0Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commits/76e0bbbb0c7efc85c5bafdde76f7bbcb5bcb0f69/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:53:18Z","email":"Kingtut22009@gmail.com","name":"vonmiller1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T16:13:38Z","email":"Kingtut22009@gmail.com","name":"vonmiller1"},"message":"Default the VPC-SC perimeter and the org policies to off\n\nSlice 7 of the 2026-09-23 posture rule: every compliance control that is not\nirreversible defaults off in code, and terraform.tfvars.example carries the\nproduction form. The perimeter (enable_vpc_sc) and the project org policies\n(enable_org_policies) defaulted on, so a plan with no var file needed org-level\nroles and an access policy, and a second stack in a shared project fought the\none that owns them.\n\nBoth now default to false, with a sentence in each description saying so. The\nexample states both lines (true, the production form). The existing plan tests\nwere written under the old default, so each test file states it at file\nlevel, and a run that sets one explicitly still overrides it; a new\nposture_defaults.tftest.hcl pins the new default (no perimeter, no org policy\nunless stated). Comments that called the sovereign posture \"the default\" say\notherwise.\n\nVerified: terraform validate and terraform test green with every credential\nsource hidden.","tree":{"sha":"a0c703fea5560eb82b2d3d57b2af23521f32f1e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/git/trees/a0c703fea5560eb82b2d3d57b2af23521f32f1e6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/git/commits/76e0bbbb0c7efc85c5bafdde76f7bbcb5bcb0f69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/318769617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vonmiller1","id":318769617,"login":"vonmiller1","node_id":"U_kgDOEwAJ0Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commit/76e0bbbb0c7efc85c5bafdde76f7bbcb5bcb0f69","node_id":"C_kwDOU6lQItoAKDc2ZTBiYmJiMGM3ZWZjODVjNWJhZmRkZTc2ZjdiYmNiNWJjYjBmNjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commit/7ffe23109361531f98c548da74ba34deb40f479d","sha":"7ffe23109361531f98c548da74ba34deb40f479d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commits/7ffe23109361531f98c548da74ba34deb40f479d"}],"sha":"76e0bbbb0c7efc85c5bafdde76f7bbcb5bcb0f69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commits/76e0bbbb0c7efc85c5bafdde76f7bbcb5bcb0f69"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten