url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vonmiller1","id":318769617,"login":"vonmiller1","node_id":"U_kgDOEwAJ0Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commits/7be567c6d8c85e90f6a4415098fe6ac6051ba5d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T14:49:38Z","email":"Kingtut22009@gmail.com","name":"vonmiller1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T15:21:36Z","email":"Kingtut22009@gmail.com","name":"vonmiller1"},"message":"Bump hex-service-kit to v0.0.11: trace only through the collector\n\nv0.0.11 deletes the kit tracer''s direct Cloud Trace path (decision D1 of the\nguardrail/registry/observability plan): build_tracer raises when\nOTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT is unset, so spans can no longer leave around the\ncollector''s GenAI-content redaction. Its signature is service= alone, so the\ngcp tracer adapter stops passing project=, and its docstring stops promising\nthe unset-endpoint path to Cloud Trace.\n\nThe parity suite takes the template''s D1 contract with it: the managed tracer\nnow declares CollectorEndpointRequiredError as its refusal, on-prem''s no-op\ntracer is marked as never refusing, and a new test proves that with a\ncollector configured the tracer still degrades to a no-op offline.\n\nRelocked with this repository''s own `make lock`, which moves only the kit\npin; `make gate` green.","tree":{"sha":"fa071bc56eb8643e671ec3bd030bd96896d8442b","url":"https://api.github.com/repo