ledge-center/commit/871d28e174dc120674a155e282a28b62f73bb4e5","sha":"871d28e174dc120674a155e282a28b62f73bb4e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commits/871d28e174dc120674a155e282a28b62f73bb4e5"}],"sha":"2e7b0607dca7e164b7f67e9b69f5fb0702cf5a39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commits/2e7b0607dca7e164b7f67e9b69f5fb0702cf5a39"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/318769617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/vonmiller1","id":318769617,"login":"vonmiller1","node_id":"U_kgDOEwAJ0Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/commits/871d28e174dc120674a155e282a28b62f73bb4e5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T10:01:17Z","email":"Kingtut22009@gmail.com","name":"vonmiller1"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-06T22:45:38Z","email":"Kingtut22009@gmail.com","name":"vonmiller1"},"message":"Name the systems this repo depends on, instead of their catalog ids\n\nRepository names are unique across the organization, so a reader no longer has\nto resolve a code through a table to learn which system is meant. The catalog\ndropped its ID column, and this repository follows.\n\nBeyond prose, four identifier changes:\n\n- The review payload''s source_key prefix is the repository name. It is a dedup\n  key -- human-review-console queries on it and the local store makes it a\n  PRIMARY KEY -- so producers and the console have to agree, and the branch\n  carries the migration for rows written under the old prefix.\n- Terraform''s local.render_catalog_id becomes local.render_repository. It feeds\n  display names and descriptions, which update in place.\n- scripts/demo.py''s catalog id is deleted rather than renamed: a REPOSITORY\n  constant and a \"repository\" state key were already there beside it.\n- scripts/rename_fork.py loses --catalog-id, which had nothing left to rewrite.\n\nLines that outgrew the 100-column limit because a name is longer than an id are\nrewrapped rather than shortened by dropping the name. `ruff check`,\n`ruff format --check` and the offline tests are clean.\n\nDeployed resource identifiers are deliberately NOT changed: the Terraform\nname_prefix stems and the Secret Manager secret ids still carry the old\nlowercase id. Those name resources that exist in the deployment, and renaming a\nname_prefix destroys and recreates them, so they are an infrastructure\nmigration rather than a rename.","tree":{"sha":"12dc5ab72b21bd6180c0404250e622c8865d2650","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/git/trees/12dc5ab72b21bd6180c0404250e622c8865d2650"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vonmiller1/knowledge-center/git/commits/871d28e174dc120674a155e282a28b62f73bb4e5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/318769617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vonmiller1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/v