:"6710615151@student.tu.ac.th","name":"6710615151"},"message":"Fix Pico 4 controllers, add in-VR menu and XR locomotion\n\n- Attach inputsourceschange listener before setSession so already-connected\n  controllers aren''t missed; read input sources live from the session\n- Map three.js controller groups to hands by reported handedness\n- Attach pointer lasers at startup instead of only after a game loads\n- Add VRMenu: world-space main menu / game list / pause (B/Y) panels,\n  since HTML overlays are invisible in immersive-vr\n- Move the player via an offset reference space (thumbstick, teleport,\n  snap turn) instead of writing camera.position, which WebXR overrides\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"448f3166e456da4edabca5afd147302c93996078","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6710615151/cn360-test/git/trees/448f3166e456da4edabca5afd147302c93996078"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/6710615151/cn360-test/git/commits/1d8808417429ec6e7782e42bb69d81c1593e14ae","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/179436782?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/6710615151","id":179436782,"login":"6710615151","node_id":"U_kgDOCrH87g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/6710615151/subscriptions","ty